    <string name="questions">Questions</string>
    <string name="q_1">Why I made this app?</string>
    <string name="a_1">To help myself and others break free from bad habits using a clean, guilt-free interface.</string>
    <string name="q_2">Is my data safe?</string>
    <string name="a_2">Yes! 100% local. Your data never leaves this phone.</string>
    <string name="q_3">Who did I make this app for?</string>
    <string name="a_3">I created this app for people who, like me, are trying to get rid of bad habits… whether it\'s alcohol or self-harm. I was inspired by apps on Google Play and wanted to create a simple and clear tool that will help not only me but also my friends and others who have similar struggles 🫶🏽.</string>
    <string name="q_4">Future plans?</string>
    <string name="a_4">Just general bux fixes and whatever the people want!</string>
